### List the jobs that can be triggered in this environment
GET {{HOST}}/v2/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{hmpps_auth.token}}

### Start a job now. 202 means it was handed to a background thread, nothing more -
### read the outcome from the job's own logging and its job_log row.
POST {{HOST}}/v2/jobs/checkin-creation/run
Authorization: Bearer {{hmpps_auth.token}}
